      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<b>CONTROLS</b>

    SPACE / W / UP  -  Jump  (tap again for Double Jump)

    S
    / DOWN (hold)  -  Crouch under red lasers

    ESC  -  Pause


    <b>GOAL</b>

    Collect
    the level''s required gold stars to clear it.

    Level 1 = 10,  Level 2 = 20, 
    Level 3 = 30.


    <b>ITEMS</b>

    <color=#FFD54A>Gold Star</color>  -  counts
    toward the level goal (+score)

    <color=#39FF6A>Green Chevron</color>  - 
    SPEED RUSH: faster, huge score, unlimited jumps

    <color=#FF4A4A>Red Block
    / Laser</color>  -  hazard, avoid it!'
